{"server":"tw","storyId":"act45side_level_act45side_07_end","groupId":"act45side","stageId":"act45side_07","title":"永恆絢爛的藏品","storyCode":"SS-7","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act45side/level_act45side_07_end.txt","sourceHash":"0b96e8ff6234ae489ff15d221d1d73d8893f3f6627a752c3bbd411eaf6bede30","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"祥子正視了自己的夢境，也產生了猶豫。“母親”看出了祥子的掙扎，開導並鼓勵她離開夢境、尋求真實，祥子和“母親”做了最後的道別。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"31_g3_mini12_farmland"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"媽媽，稍等我一下好嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"母親","speakerId":"avg_npc_1941_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，去吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"31_g3_mini12_farmland"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們還好嗎？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅豆","speakerId":"avg_290_vigna_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔……還好啦，就是屁股有點痛……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"剛剛不是還見到了愛麗絲小姐……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唔……唔……唔……！"},{"type":"narration","text":"麥草堆的深處傳來一陣熟悉的聲音。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅豆","speakerId":"avg_290_vigna_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃……快點把愛麗絲挖出來！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好、好的！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"avg_338_iris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（大口喘氣）差……差點就被悶死了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們不是還要收集孩子們的願望嗎？為什麼還會出現在這裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_369_bena_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿嘿，工作比想像中的還順利，這邊的孩子們意外地乖巧，所以就提前結束了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅豆","speakerId":"avg_290_vigna_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我本來是想體驗一下在鄉間開車的感覺，沒想到半路出問題了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_369_bena_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我以前修理過這種車，我們快點一起修好它吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"avg_338_iris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，也不知道今天是幸運還是倒楣……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"avg_338_iris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"本來我還有點擔心哪裡會出問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"avg_338_iris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒想到今天的工作出奇地順利，更沒想到的是，會在這種小事上出現意外。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"avg_338_iris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但願能儘快修好吧……這樣今晚就能返程了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今晚返程……？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"祥子轉身看向身後。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"31_g3_mini12_farmland"},{"type":"narration","text":"就在不遠處，母親正微笑地看著她和她的夥伴們。\n她發覺了女兒回眸的視線，於是輕輕地點了點頭。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"31_g3_mini12_farmland"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"avg_338_iris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是……你的母親？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"avg_338_iris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們長得真像，尤其是眼睛和嘴巴，給人一種既溫柔又堅定的感覺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……可是我並不堅定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"avg_338_iris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼這麼說？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因為，我……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"愛麗絲小姐，你是仙女對吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"avg_338_iris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯……怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"仙女會傾聽人的願望，然後將願望在夢中化為短暫的“現實”……對吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"avg_338_iris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是如果，真的有人在夢境中無法自拔，那又該怎麼辦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"avg_338_iris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真正的仙女，是不會允許這樣的事情發生的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"avg_338_iris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"待在夢裡的時間過長，最後只會讓人分不清現實和夢境。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果她一直不甦醒呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"avg_338_iris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"祥子，最嚴重的結果從來不是無法甦醒，而是將夢中的一切當作理所應當後，卻在某一刻醒來，發現經歷的一切全是泡影。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"avg_338_iris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在夢中度過了無比幸福的一生後，卻發現自己又回到了現實，一切又回到了原點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"avg_338_iris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"年幼的軀體，蒼老的靈魂。夢中的一切都無法抓住，從此只能孑然一身地行於世間。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"avg_338_iris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣的夢，真的好嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"avg_338_iris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"本該失敗的事，就不該靠夢境去逃避；本該錯過的人，就應該好好地說聲再見。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"祥子再次轉身看向身後。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"31_g3_mini12_farmland"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"31_g3_mini12_farmland"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"avg_338_iris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我好像說得有點多了……是不是打擾你們母女相聚了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……沒有啦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"avg_338_iris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，曾經有一個對我而言很重要的人，也問過我同樣的問題。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"65_g2_dreamcastlehall"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那時的我沒有給出堅決的答案，最後釀成了無可挽回的錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"所以我才會這麼在意這件事情……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"31_g3_mini12_farmland"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"喂——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"車子終於修好啦——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"紅豆，你不要再碰了！千萬別碰！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅豆","speakerId":"avg_290_vigna_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅豆","speakerId":"avg_290_vigna_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們快點上去吧——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"avg_338_iris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"祥子小姐，你會跟我們一起回去嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"祥子又一次看向了身後的“母親”。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"31_g3_mini12_farmland"},{"type":"narration","text":"“母親”依然在那裡站著，似乎在等待著什麼。\n在等待她的許諾？還是她的宣判？\n她只是一直站在那裡，對自己的女兒報以最溫柔的微笑。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"31_g3_mini12_farmland"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅豆","speakerId":"avg_290_vigna_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅豆","speakerId":"avg_290_vigna_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒關係啦，祥子。你就在家裡多待一段時間吧，你最近這麼累，也該休息一下了。我會幫你通知一下人事部的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好……謝謝。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"65_g6_sakikopianoroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我再試試——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“母親”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1941_1","isRemote":false,"text":"祥子，就先到這裡吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“母親”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1941_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你已經很累了吧？我們來泡點紅茶，再慢慢——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是因為太緊張了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“母親”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1941_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不如我們來聊聊天吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“母親”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1941_1","isRemote":false,"text":"剛才那些人，是祥子的朋友嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，大家都是羅德島的同事，也都是很好的朋友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“母親”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1941_1","isRemote":false,"text":"羅德島……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，是一家醫藥公司，有一艘巨大的陸行艦。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_0_rhodes3"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我們在艦船上工作和生活，去往這個世界的任何地方。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"65_g6_sakikopianoroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“母親”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1941_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……世界？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……泰拉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“母親”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1941_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真是有趣的說法呢~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“母親”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1941_1","isRemote":false,"text":"羅德島上，有可以讓人練琴的琴房嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有，巡航期間沒有那麼多娛樂活動，很多幹員都會玩一些樂器來打發時間。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我有時候也會在宿舍裡用可攜式電子琴彈兩首曲子，紅豆還會組建自己的樂隊——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“母親”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1941_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那祥子有組建自己的樂隊嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“母親”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1941_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是和紅豆小姐一起？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是，是和其他人……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“母親”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1941_1","isRemote":false,"text":"媽媽有點好奇，和祥子一起組樂隊的都是什麼樣的人呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"65_i01_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"有一個雖然總是和我的意見不合，但是很有上進心的努力派鼓手，我們比起朋友，更像是戰友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"有一個技術高超的貝斯手，總是認真地幫大家做好行程管理之類的幕後工作，身為工作夥伴的她十分值得信任。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"有一個擅長作詞的吉他手兼主唱，她明明還有自己的偶像工作要做，但即使忙碌，也一直支持著我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"還有一位吉他手，我們從小就是很好的朋友，在……在我離開家一個人時，總會陪著我……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“母親”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"聽起來，你們是一個親密無間的團體。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不，實際上我們總是吵架，甚至樂隊還解散過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“母親”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那你們現在有和好如初嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我和她們走散了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"她們在很遠很遠的地方，我沒辦法到達的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“母親”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"有多遠？從維多利亞到烏薩斯？還是更遠？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"65_g6_sakikopianoroom"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“母親”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1941_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼猶豫了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因為……因為……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我怕我去找她們的話，就要離開你們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我害怕再也見不到你——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“母親”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1941_1","isRemote":false,"text":"傻孩子，我一直都在啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，你不是離開我了嗎？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ltroom"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"65_g6_sakikopianoroom"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g5_srcpark"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"64_g2_jindastreet_n"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor_u"},{"type":"narration","text":"“爸爸，看到現在的你，媽媽一定會傷心的！”\n“媽媽不是說過嗎……”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"65_g6_sakikopianoroom"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"65_i10_1"},{"type":"narration","text":"溫暖的體溫，真切的呼吸。\n媽媽溫柔地注視著祥子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“母親”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"對不起，祥子……媽媽對你說謊了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"欸……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“母親”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你早就知道，我不是你真正的媽媽吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“母親”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"對不起，媽媽一直在小心地掩飾著這個小小的謊言。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“母親”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"其實我根本沒有參加過你的高中入學典禮。在你問我以前，我記憶中的你還是一個國中生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“母親”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"而我也不知為何，最近我眼裡的祥子，即使在開心地笑著，身邊依然縈繞著一層陰雲……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“母親”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"祥子，從什麼時候開始，會有這樣的表情了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“母親”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"在我不知道的這段時間裡，你到底經歷了什麼痛苦呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我……我……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“母親”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"對不起，關於這些，媽媽都一無所知。我唯一知道的是，在你最痛苦的時候，我卻沒能陪伴在你的身邊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“母親”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"祥子，能見到你，媽媽真的、真的很開心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“母親”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"媽媽真的、真的很想看著你長大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“母親”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我也很想站在台下，親眼看看你的演出。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“母親”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你新認識的那些朋友……我也很想見見她們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“母親”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"媽媽很貪心，想知道關於你的一切，想一直陪伴在你的身邊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“母親”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但正因為我是你的媽媽，正因為我深愛著你……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“母親”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"所以才想讓你離開這裡，去尋找你自己真正的生活。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“母親”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"祥子，離開吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“母親”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"回到你的“世界”去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"媽媽……！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"65_i10_2"},{"type":"narration","text":"奔湧的情感終於止不住地潰堤，祥子將頭埋入母親的懷中，嚎啕大哭。\n而母親只是輕拍女兒的背，喃喃地安撫，就像她以前經常做的那樣。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"65_g5_sakikodininghall"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“父親”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1940_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？祥子，你又要出門嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“母親”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1941_1","isRemote":false,"text":"祥子接下來有重要的事要做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“父親”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1940_1","isRemote":false,"text":"才回家多久而已，不能再多留一下嗎……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“母親”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1941_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……親愛的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“父親”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1940_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“父親”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1940_1","isRemote":false,"text":"祥子，我已經和你媽媽統一戰線了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“父親”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1940_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（哭腔）就是……就是……你在外面一定要記得好好吃飯哦！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我知道啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那……我就出門了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"母親&父親","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"母親&父親","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"祥子，一路順風——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
